.th DR IV 8/5/78
.sh NAME
dr \*- DR11-K 16-bit parallel interface
.sh DESCRIPTION
The file
.it imlac
refers to the 16-bit parallel link to the Imlac PDS-4 via the
dr11-k interface.
The file may be read and written,
and though it is a character file,
2 bytes must be provided before a 16-bit transfer will take place.
.s3
While unopened, input is connected to output for diagnostic purposes.
.sh FILES
/dev/imlac, /dev/dr
